# Tests

- Use pytest.
- Put shared fixtures in `tests/conftest.py` and reusable helpers under `tests/support/`.
- Prefer fixtures over copied setup (`git_repo`, `tmp_dir`, `run_cli`, `git_repository`, `yaml_file`).
- Prefer `@pytest.mark.parametrize` when several inputs share the same assertions.
- Avoid duplicating `_git_repo` / tempdir / CLI runners inside individual test modules.
- Keep test tempdirs outside the Codoc checkout package paths.
